    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρρίχ-ῐος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρρίχη, π. [εἶδος], ὄρχησις</span>,
			the <u>Pyrrhic</u> dance, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				3.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δρόμος</span>”
