					4.2.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Metric,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποὺς π</span>. <i>a pyrrhic</i>,
			i.e. a foot consisting of two short syllables, used in the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρρίχη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				41.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				1.15
			</span></i>.</div>
